zJVMQ","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689128605428,"modifiedTime":1689128880401,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Thicket Urchin Venom","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[type:fortitude|dc:33]</p>\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[2d6[poison]] damage, @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Clumsy]{Clumsy 1}, and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Stupefied]{Stupefied 1} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> [[/r 3d6[poison]]] damage, @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Clumsy]{Clumsy 2}, and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Stupefied]{Stupefied 2} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> [[/r 4d6[poison]]] damage, @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Clumsy]{Clumsy 3}, and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Stupefied]{Stupefied 3} (1 round)</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["poison"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"Bxj1tLLDSkXJ7gIQ","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689128611393,"modifiedTime":1691261012333,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Impale","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A creature hit by a thicket urchin's harpoon Strike becomes impaled on its barbed harpoon. Such a creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Grabbed]{Grabbed} (@Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.Escape]{Escape} DC 37, or 39 if the harpoon was critical hit), and exposed to thicket urchin venom at the end of each of its turns as long as it remains grabbed.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"XmqSFAhSpyvYt7XQ","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689128612579,"modifiedTime":1689128669346,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Drag","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The thicket urchin has a creature impaled</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The thicket urchin reels in its harpoon, pulling an impaled creature toward it. The thicket urchin attempts an Athletics check against an impaled target's Fortitude DC.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The thicket urchin pulls the target 30 feet closer.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The thicket urchin pulls the target 10 feet closer.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is no longer impaled.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publicat